│ not have any major effect on flare occurrence or RA disease activity metrics over the 24-month follow-up. The        │
│ majority of patients in the intervention arm preferred self-management to an expedited visit with their rheumatology │
│ provider. TRIAL REGISTRATION ClinicalTrials.gov Identifier: NCT02382783 (                                            │
│ https://clinicaltrials.gov/ct2/show/NCT02382783 ) Key Points • The flare management intervention had no effect on    │
