│ "Improving treatment of late life depression in primary care: a randomized clinical trial", "abstract": "OBJECTIVE   │
│ Facilitate primary care physicians\' compliance with recommended standards of care for late life depression by       │
│ reducing barriers to recognition and treatment. DESIGN Randomized controlled clinical trial of physician-targeted    │
│ interventions. SETTING Academic primary care group practice caring for an urban, medically indigent patient          │
